      "title": "Relayed packets",
      "description": "'send' packets received for relaying, relayed and dropped (relayserver_send_packets_recv_total, _sent_total, _dropped_total). iroh-relay counts a drop only when the destination is not connected here or writing to it failed, not when its queue is full.",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
